  8   4010              ; A loop that takes exactly one frame and runs six routines, each with the
  9   4010              ; border in its own colour. The display is off, so that the border fills the
 10   4010              ; screen (figure 14.1). Every price is the MSX's, Zilog's plus one for every
 11   4010              ; M1, and the wait at the end makes up the rest of the frame: 71,364
 12   4010              ; T-states on a 50 Hz machine, 59,736 on a 60 Hz one.
